<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 2 Best in Slot Gear list for Holy Priest Healer in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Ulduar, Naxxramas, Obsidian Sanctum, and Eye of Eternity. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Holy Priest Healer Phase 2</h2>
<i>Healer gearing always heavily depends on playstyle, situation and raid environment so treat the BiS list below as a guideline rather than a gospel.</i>
<br/>
<br/>While there is a variety of strong items  that can be considered Phase 2 BiS, some of them naturally end up being rare hardmode drops or highly sought after pieces such that will generally go to caster dps first. Due to that, the gear embed below has both a contested and a more realistic setup to choose from, though most players will likely end up with something inbetween. <br/>
<br/>This is why despite the existence of very powerful offset pieces, the realistic setup ends up using the more easily accessible tier pieces in multiple slots despite the 4p bonus not being particularly impactful for us.<br/>
<br/>As for gemming, there is a variety of viable way to gem your gear at this point. The two typical approaches boil down to solely focusing on one powerful stat outside of activating your meta gem or using mixed gems to pick up bonuses along the way to gain more overall stats while still fixating on either throughput or sustain.<br/>
<br/>Due to the high amount of sustain stats found on the high item level pieces by default, as well the strong regeneration trinkets found in T8, the set below opts for the latter and is primarily centered around throughput. Even so, you might find sustain-oriented gemming more useful during progression or even on farm, so simply go with what works best for your playstyle.<br/>
