<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Conquest for Holy Priest Healer Phase 2</h3>The first three items on this list provide a relatively similar stat gain, technically making the gloves the most worthwhile purchase due to the low emblem cost. However, the two tier pieces are much harder to replace as there is only one possible upgrade for each of them, which is also a contested hardmode drop in both cases. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45831/sash-of-potent-incantations">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Potent Incantations</span></a> is a slight upgrade over most previously available items but is outshadowed by the crafted belt and the upgrade from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40398/leggings-of-mortal-arrogance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Mortal Arrogance</span></a> to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45848/legwraps-of-the-master-conjurer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legwraps of the Master Conjurer</span></a> is only fairly minor.<br/>
<br/>Finally, the necklace is roughly as good as the Malygos 25m quest necklace, which can now be obtained in the 10m instance as well. Not really worth spending badges on unless you already bought everything and could still make use of it.<br/>
