<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Holy Priest Healer Phase 2</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Holy Priest Healer Phase 2</h3>There isn't much to be said about this slot, as the tier piece is easily available via emblems and beats out everything other than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45497/crown-of-luminescence">
