<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50370/arcanum-of-blissful-mending">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_shieldmastery.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Blissful Mending</span></a> or <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50368/arcanum-of-burning-mysteries">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Burning Mysteries</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1091/the-wyrmrest-accord">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Wyrmrest Accord</span></a> and <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1090/kirin-tor">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor</span></a>, respectively.<div class="pad"></div>
