<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Holy Priest Healer Phase 2</h3>Considering the offpiece is obtainable through a 10m for once, it's not too unrealistic to eventually get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46068/amice-of-inconceivable-horror">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amice of Inconceivable Horror</span></a> but in the meantime the tier pieces or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46013/underworld-mantle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_97.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Underworld Mantle</span></a> are good placeholders. That said, if you are somehow still running a Hybrid spec at this point, sticking to the 4p would definitely be better.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50336/greater-inscription-of-the-crag">
