<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Holy Priest Healer Phase 2</h3>Due to being the reward of a very sought after quest drop, the 252 Algalon cloak likely won't be available to most Priests, so sticking to the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44005/pennant-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_naxxramas_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pennant Cloak</span></a> and holding out for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45486/drape-of-the-sullen-goddess">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_naxxramas_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of the Sullen Goddess</span></a> is likely the way to go.<br/>
<br/>If you do manage to get your hands on the 25m version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46053/reply-code-alpha">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_arcanetorrent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reply-Code Alpha</span></a>, both the cloak and the ring are good choices. However, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45618/sunglimmer-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sunglimmer Cloak</span></a> doubles as one of the best Shadow Priest cloaks, making it the recommended pick.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63765/springy-arachnoweave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Springy Arachnoweave</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47898/enchant-cloak-greater-speed">
