<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Holy Priest Healer Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45558/cord-of-the-white-dawn">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_40b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the White Dawn</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45557/sash-of-ancient-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Ancient Power</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45119/embrace-of-the-leviathan">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_49.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Embrace of the Leviathan</span></a> should be your go-to choices here, with the first two having the added benefit of being significantly easier to obtain. Alternatively, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40561/leash-of-heedless-magic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leash of Heedless Magic</span></a> still holds up fairly well if you currently have that one.<br/>
<br/>Eventually you might be lucky enough to upgrade to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45619/starwatchers-binding">
