<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a> to get either of the tier legs quickly. Although there are also offpiece options available for this slot, they are not noticeably better than the tier pieces for you, so it is advisable to leave them for the casters, who they are more suitable for.<br/>
