<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Holy Priest Healer Phase 2</h3>There are three great trinkets for pure regeneration to choose from in this phase:<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46051/meteorite-crystal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduarraid_misc_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Meteorite Crystal</span></a> is the best one out of the three and always provides you with considerable amounts of regeneration as long as you keep casting spells during the 20s duration of the on-use. In practice, it will provide even more Mp5 than listed in the table below, as you can combine the effect with haste buffs like <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=2825/bloodlust">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_bloodlust.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bloodlust</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a>. Despite this, you should likely pass the first drop to your Holy Paladin as they will use it for the rest of the expansion.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45703/spark-of-hope">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_invisibilitytotem.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spark of Hope</span></a> is more consistent than the other two in terms of it not being dependent on you starting fights on full mana and using your Shadowfiend well, but instead only becomes great when you can ensure high casts per minute for the entire duration of the encounter.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44255/darkmoon-card-greatness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarotgreatness.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Greatness</span></a> still performs well but is heavily reliant on you properly aligning the proc with your Shadowfiend during encounters to reach the value listed below. <br/>
<br/>Besides these, there are also several good throughput options for once, with the top ones being:<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a> is technically by far your best choice for throughput, though you will likely never be able to acquire it.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40432/illustration-of-the-dragon-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_hyjal_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Illustration of the Dragon Soul</span></a> is now easily available from 10m <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4493/the-obsidian-sanctum">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Obsidian Sanctum</span></a> and the best choice for sole spell power. However, unless you are certain you will not be able to make use of the extra regeneration, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45535/show-of-faith">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_improvedresistanceauras.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Show of Faith</span></a> might be a better pick for most players.<div class="pad"></div>
