<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Holy Priest Healer Phase 2</h2>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-and-two-handed-weapons-for-holy-priest-healer-phase-2">Main and Two-Handed Weapons for Holy Priest Healer Phase 2</h4>As a Holy Priest, you are tied for being the third best spec when it comes to how well you can utilize <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46017/valanyr-hammer-of-ancient-kings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Val'anyr, Hammer of Ancient Kings</span></a>, so you will likely have to hope your raid group keeps clearing Ulduar once the next phase is out to be able to get one. <br/>
<br/>In the meantime, you can opt for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45457/staff-of-endless-winter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Endless Winter</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45886/icecore-staff">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icecore Staff</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45612/constellus">
